{"id":"n24944-1-8","stage":3,"title":"천장 · 顶棚","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24944-1-8-1","ko":"비만 오면 천장에서 물이 떨어져요.","zh":"只要一下雨，天花板上就会漏水。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비만","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비만","audio":"/audio/e9b52f31fc48cb25074a.mp3"}},{"text":"오면","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오면","audio":"/audio/db4c994ab297c56bbe00.mp3"}},{"text":"천장에서","meaning":"顶棚，天棚","explanation":"천장：顶棚，天棚；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"천장","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24944","senseId":"1","lemma":"천장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"천장에서","audio":"/audio/1a4b114332fe42f3700c.mp3"}},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물이","audio":"/audio/bbb693e9d07d2f260739.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어져요.","meaning":"掉，下降","explanation":"떨어지다：掉，下降；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어져요","audio":"/audio/15656d4ea795d96689af.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"c80d260f8de85a6e","term":"천장","zh":"顶棚，天棚","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3","entryId":"24944","definition":"一座建筑物的室内顶部。","pronunciation":["천장"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"掉，下降","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"由上往下落。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fbe1efa4d54d2803e3c5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24944-1-8-2","ko":"천장에 구멍이 나 물이 새는군요. 공사를 해야겠어요.","zh":"原来天花板上有个洞，所以才会漏水。得找人来修一下了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"천장에","meaning":"顶棚，天棚","explanation":"천장：顶棚，天棚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"천장","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24944","senseId":"1","lemma":"천장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"천장에","audio":"/audio/ed027f6e60fc8087a36b.mp3"}},{"text":"구멍이","meaning":"窟窿，洞，孔","explanation":"구멍：窟窿，洞，孔；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구멍","audio":"/audio/bdf45aec9d9cea46cc2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34923","senseId":"1","lemma":"구멍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구멍이","audio":"/audio/00f055d11d92593f5f1a.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"钻，打，划","explanation":"나다：钻，打，划；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"3","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물이","audio":"/audio/bbb693e9d07d2f260739.mp3"}},{"text":"새는군요.","meaning":"漏","explanation":"새다：漏；는군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"새다","audio":"/audio/d152606bd862b7092fd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16231","senseId":"1","lemma":"새다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새는군요","audio":"/audio/770eea7533b133f8ea5a.mp3"}},{"text":"공사를","meaning":"工程，施工","explanation":"공사：工程，施工；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23401","senseId":"1","lemma":"공사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공사를","audio":"/audio/1ee0eceee0a5736cdab5.mp3"}},{"text":"해야겠어요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야겠어요","audio":"/audio/15ef7a396b0928dbee01.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c80d260f8de85a6e","term":"천장","zh":"顶棚，天棚","audio":"/audio/c80d260f8de85a6ed343.mp3","entryId":"24944","definition":"一座建筑物的室内顶部。","pronunciation":["천장"]},{"id":"bdf45aec9d9cea46","term":"구멍","zh":"窟窿，洞，孔","audio":"/audio/bdf45aec9d9cea46cc2f.mp3","entryId":"34923","definition":"穿破或挖出的位置。","pronunciation":["구멍"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"钻，打，划","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现洞或伤口等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"d152606bd862b709","term":"새다","zh":"漏","audio":"/audio/d152606bd862b7092fd5.mp3","entryId":"16231","definition":"气体或液体从缝或洞里泄出去。","pronunciation":["새다"]},{"id":"25e51843741edb40","term":"공사","zh":"工程，施工","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3","entryId":"23401","definition":"重新建造或改造设施或建筑物。","pronunciation":["공사"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a9f1d82fbae9b3b7650f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24944","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":108,"sequenceScore":2.8176,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["原来天花板上有个洞，所以才会漏水。得找人来修一下了。","只要一下雨，天花板上就会漏水。","我晕车了，我开一下窗户。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["只要一下雨，天花板上就会漏水。","我晕车了，我开一下窗户。","原来天花板上有个洞，所以才会漏水。得找人来修一下了。"],"answer":2}]}
